WEBVTT

00:27:28.756 --> 00:27:30.088
Most movies don't get made.

00:27:30.112 --> 00:27:32.884
Most scientific ideas
don't revolutionize the world.

00:27:32.908 --> 00:27:35.656
Like, odds are against it.

00:27:35.680 --> 00:27:38.202
And it's a very rational
stance to take to say,

00:27:38.226 --> 00:27:39.798
"Why should I bother doing this,

00:27:39.822 --> 00:27:43.425
and why should I invest
this treasure of my time --

00:27:43.449 --> 00:27:46.838
my time and my labor, which is my greatest
treasure as a human being --

00:27:46.862 --> 00:27:49.628
why should I invest in this thing
when there's no guarantee

00:27:49.652 --> 00:27:51.666
that I'm going to get anything out of it?"

00:27:51.690 --> 00:27:53.266
And I can't ever promise anybody.

00:27:53.290 --> 00:27:56.835
I don't blow smoke up people's butts
and tell them that it's going to work,

00:27:56.859 --> 00:27:58.682
because it doesn't always work for me.

00:27:58.706 --> 00:28:01.639
But what I will tell them, and I
can absolutely guarantee you,